{{dercat|nl|frk|gem-pro|ine-pro|inh=3}}
From {{inh|nl|dum|macht}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*maht}}, from {{inh|nl|gmw-pro|*mahti}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*mahtiz}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|nl|mogen|t1=to may, to be allowed|-t|t2=verbal noun|id2=verbal noun}}.

